  "content": "In some of the incidents, the attackers used \"escalating tactics\" that included posing as IT staff to gain physical access to corporate offices to attempt direct data theft from endpoint devices, Google said. Last month, the FBI warned about members of the group, also tracked as Luna Moth and Chatty Spider, personally showing up at a victim's office location on the pretext of needing to reimage their system and inserting a USB device into it for stealing data.",
